<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from December 26 to January 1 the 1997:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 58.22</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 62.00</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 63.75</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 66.95</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$164.09</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$123.07</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 85.50</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 21.70</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.17</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 24.02</p>
</text>
